# What a vault does NOT keep (v3 td vault.md §2).
#
# Two kinds of thing, and the rule for both fits on one line: `run/` is
# throwaway, and machine-local facts are wrong on any other machine.

# The machine layer. Clone paths on this disk, and nothing that survives a move.
.local/

# Throwaway runtime. A shift's run/ holds Herdr pane ids, which would look
# authoritative on a machine where those panes do not exist; a task's run/ holds
# the wait lock and the beacon.
tasks/*/run/
tasks/*/shifts/*/run/
tasks/*/.enter.lock

.DS_Store
